## Baseline Tasks

- Extend the rubric with challenge-specific criteria.
- Incorporate patterns from resolved challenges, existing solution PRs, and
  review comments.
- Record concrete evidence paths and rerun commands.
- Check that the branch and draft PR both expose a current Success Criteria
  coverage table.
- Fail closed if the PR description keeps verification entrypoints separate
  from per-function coverage instead of embedding the relevant harness/start
  symbol/reproducer details into each function entry.
- Fail closed if a concrete witness test is being counted as verification
  without a symbolic or contract-shaped proof harness.

